cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite the archived version."
type: dataset
title: "AI-Driven Credit Risk Assessment for Bangladesh SMEs: Dataset and Analysis Code"
version: "3.1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-02
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.18525277
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/shoumyac/bd-sme-research"
url: "https://github.com/shoumyac/bd-sme-research"
abstract: >
  1,200 SME loan records from Bangladesh (supplied by BASIC Bank Limited and Bangladesh Bank, loans originated
  July 2023 to June 2025, collected July 2024 to June 2026) with a centralised benchmark and code for studying
  whether federated training changes the explanations given to declined applicants. Data licence CC BY 4.0, code licence MIT.
  Version note: the data file is identical in all versions. The earlier releases (v1, 2026-02-08; v2.0, 2026-06-05), on which the
  IntelliSys 2026 chapter (doi:10.1007/978-3-032-32729-1_33) was prepared, described the data period as 2022 to 2023, which was wrong;
  v3.0 and later state the correct dates given above.
keywords:
  - credit risk
  - SME finance
  - Bangladesh
  - federated learning
  - explainable AI
  - SHAP
